WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.270
<i>If ever there were a fated showdown,
this would be it.</i>

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.270
<i>Not only did the magical girl 
destroy the Dark Realm,</i>

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:17.160
<i>she's also taken the Great Jahy's 
symbol of power, her mana crystal.</i>

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.660
<i>Ever since, the Great Jahy
 has thirsted for retribution.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.370
<i>And now, the destined
battle is about to begin...</i>

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.350
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.480
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.850
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.020
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.270
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:11.020
<b>Restoration Plan No. 14

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:11.150
Today is the day I defeat you
 and take back my mana crystal!

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:15.010
You're... that little girl?

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.550
Just watch this!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.800
I see.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.630
You're a creature of the Dark Realm.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:34.930
Correct.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.620
You've been making a fool far too often,

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.800
but now you'll pay...

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:44.290
For destroying the Dark Realm,
and for stealing my mana crystal!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:48.980
<i>Mana crystals?</i>

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.110
You've got an interesting fighting style.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.580
Here I come!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.440
Not bad.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:42.950
That's my line.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.910
I'm sorry, but I won't give 
your mana crystal back.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.710
And I will take the rest you possess.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:55.910
Why? Why are you so fixated 
on the mana crystals?

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.460
Why try to take all of humanity's 
misfortune upon yourself?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.600
It is heaven's will.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.880
I am to destroy the mana crystals 
and free humanity of misfortune.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:07.990
Heaven's will? What's a lowly
 human like you going to do?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.600
All you're doing is taking
 the misfortune upon yourself!

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.060
You know nothing about me!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.900
You're right! I don't!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.580
Then why don't I teach you?

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.070
I'd always been prone to misfortune.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.930
Without anyone to love me
or anyone to depend upon,

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.720
I've always been alone.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:31.640
But even so, once I became a magical girl,

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:36.790
I was able to gather mana crystals
and save people by assuming their misfortune.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.800
So now I can live my life
 feeling connected to them.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.550
This was the mission granted to me
when I had no one and nothing!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.350
Your mission is to sacrifice yourself for others?!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.760
Shut up!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.980
This mission... I'm the only 
one who can carry it out!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:05:00.940
I've always held out on my own, so taking 
on such misfortune is nothing to me!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:03.770
I've got a mission, too.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.900
One I've struggled with by myself.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:10.120
But I... Even I...

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.970
<i>Even when times are sad...</i>

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.020
<i>Even when times are hard...</i>

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.840
<i>Even when I'm ready to give up...</i>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.700
<i>I'm no longer alone.</i>

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.800
<i>I've got people by my side. 
People who support me.</i>

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.760
<i>If I were on my own, I would have 
been crushed a long time ago.</i>

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.510
<i>But her... She's...</i>

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.230
<i>She's the wretched murderer 
of the Demon Lord!</i>

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:40.980
<i>Still... I can't leave it at that!</i>

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.900
You're wrong!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.650
Shouldering all that misfortune yourself?

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:47.110
Are you stupid?!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:52.760
I lost everything when you 
destroyed the Dark Realm.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:54.790
I've suffered so much because of you.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.500
Even now, I'm still suffering!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.160
You've brought misfortune upon me.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:00.700
And yet...

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:07.420
That's not reason enough for you to bear 
all misfortune upon your own shoulders!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:10.910
I'm going to take back every last mana crystal

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.640
and free you from misfortune!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.740
You say you're on your own?

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.330
Ha! What an imbecile.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.310
I won't let you be alone anymore.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:23.920
How about it?

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:27.200
If you give me the mana crystals, 
I'll love you so much

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.460
that you'll see how stupid your mission is.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:33.200
Did you... just say you won't 
let me be alone anymore?

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.410
Yeah.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.000
And that you're going to love me so much?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.020
Yeah.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:43.420
You won't stop liking me even if 
you get caught up in my bad luck?

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.510
You think something like that can scare me?

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.920
Even if I don't know 
my own strength and injure you?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.320
I'm the Dark Realm's second-in-command.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:55.970
I'm not so soft.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.940
If you really mean it, 
then I'll hand over the crystals.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.750
You'll love me?!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.730
I'm so happy to hear it!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:18.490
Thank you. You're the first person 
who's ever said that to me.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.080
I've never had even one single friend.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:25.120
If me suffering misfortune 
is misfortune for you...

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.780
Well, I didn't say <i>that</i>.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.070
I'm not going to collect
mana crystals anymore!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:33.880
And from now on, I will live for you!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:37.310
By the way, what's your name?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.180
It's... Jahy.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.900
Jahy? Jahy... Jahy-kun!

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:45.900
I'm sorry for everything, Jahy-kun!

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:48.820
From now on, I'll be on your side!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.820
R-Right...

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.910
Jahy-kun! I'm here!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.790
What is it?

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:04.000
I want to sh-sh-show you my house!

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:06.640
I've got work today.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.780
Jahy-kun! Jahy-kun!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:10.850
It doesn't have to be today!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.300
Any time is fine!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.670
I've prepared lots of snacks!

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.020
Snacks?

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:21.770
I'm so happy.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.760
I invited you so many times, 
but you've never come over.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:26.980
<i>That's because of </i>how<i> you invited me...</i>

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.190
Jahy-kun, please come to my house!

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.650
Jahy-kun, want to go do something fun?!

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.110
Jahy-kun, you must come to my house!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:37.410
I'm sorry...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.160
You're the first person I've ever invited over,
 so I'm new to all this.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.520
I've got a friend coming over!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.190
Huh? Are we friends?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:48.710
What?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.900
Aren't we?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.780
So it was all a lie?

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:58.100
You said that you'd free
me of all this misfortune...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.600
That you would love me so much...

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.980
And all of that was a lie?!

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.020
It's too cruel!

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.900
Okay! I get it already! Stop crying!

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:12.330
You and I are friends!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.940
Are you happy now?

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.100
Yeah!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:17.820
This is exhausting.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.840
There are the mana crystals, of course,
but there are other things I wish to show you

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.880
that I believe will help restore the Dark Realm.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.540
Help restore the Dark Realm?

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.920
But you're the one who destroyed 
it for no reason in the first place.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.600
And I am very sorry about that.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.430
What I did to you all was horrible.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.470
Speaking of, didn't you say 
you were assigned that mission?

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.610
So destroying the Dark Realm 
wasn't of your own volition?

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:46.200
Correct. I was only tasked

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:50.150
with destroying the mana crystal 
and freeing humanity of misfortune.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.380
I bear no ill will toward the Dark Realm.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.350
And who'd you get this mission from?

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:56.750
Well...

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.070
Let's go over the details at my place.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:03.550
<i>I think she said that she has no family.</i>

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.240
<i>Yet she spent all her time collecting
mana crystals and not working...</i>

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.190
<i>Moreover, even bearing all that misfortune,</i>

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.670
<i>she was doing pretty well for herself.</i>

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.330
<i>She must be totally loaded!</i>

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.520
<i>That's perfect.</i>

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:21.040
<i>I'll take her mana crystals and her house!</i>

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.680
We're here!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.980
<i>Th-Th-Th-This is it?</i>

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.620
Due to the mana crystals, 
this house is riddled with calamity.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.330
You could've said so sooner!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.110
Heh, things never change around here.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.880
Is there more?

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.830
Actually, the room where I 
store the mana crystals...

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.800
There's a shade there
 that comes out after dark.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:02.710
Since I saw it, I haven't gone inside.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.420
I-I'm not scared of ghosts...

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:07.680
Ah, Jahy-kun!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.440
A ghost!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.550
The... The Dark Lord...

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.150
Stand back, Jahy-kun!

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.810
H-Hey, that's my dinner!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:55.270
So <i>you're</i> the reason my food 
stores have been diminishing!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.980
You thief!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Taste a magical girl's Hammer of Justice!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.490
You insolent fool!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.490
Have you no idea who this is?!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.390
Gracing us with her presence,

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:12.330
it's the supreme ruler of the Dark Realm...

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.380
the Dark Lord!

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.150
Huh?

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:17.990
Your Lordship...

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:21.400
You've gotten so small... How terrible...

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.540
Why are you just standing there?!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.960
You are in front of the Dark Lord!

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.310
She says, "You could at least
 get me a glass of water!"

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.920
Bring some at once!

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:39.530
Wh-What?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.200
So this is really the Dark Lord...

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:54.660
Then that enormous mana crystal I destroyed 
wasn't a manifestation of hers?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:58.880
Gosh, you really are clueless.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.750
That was only one facet of the Dark Lord.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.380
A core mana crystal that gave 
the Dark Realm its form.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.870
You could think of it as her heart.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:11.430
So how is she here now 
if I shattered her heart?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.280
Mana crystals <i>are</i> the Dark Lord.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:21.120
Wherever they appear in high
concentration, so too will she.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:25.570
This just means you collected
a sufficient amount.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.820
Thank you for that.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.520
<i>This is the first time a friend 
has ever thanked me for something!</i>

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:34.310
Well, that's enough difficult discussion for now.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.190
Today, we celebrate!

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.770
It's the Dark Lord's revival party!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.780
A party?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.600
Hey! Don't just sit there!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.410
Bring more snacks!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.040
O-Of course.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.720
Eat all you want.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:55.430
Wow, that's good!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.910
To think such an auspicious day would come...

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.400
The best of all since I came to the human world!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.070
I say, these cookies really are good.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.820
The Dark Lord is enjoying them, too.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.580
I'm so glad you like them.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.190
I got them from a famous store.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.960
There's a lot more, so eat up!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.380
Wow, good job!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.300
I just got praised again!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.010
Today, we're going to eat 
and drink ourselves stupid!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:29.380
I bought a lot of juice, too.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.720
Yes! Wonderful, wonderful!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.600
This really is the best day...

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:49.730
Here's the juice...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.370
What? We're already out of cookies?!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.370
Don't worry, Jahy-kun.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.850
You can't have a party with just cookies alone,

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:00.540
so I ordered some delivery!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.590
Whoa!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.470
I don't know that I've ever laid eyes
 on anything like this in the human realm!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.420
You were scary as a magical girl.
Literally the worst.

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:14.470
But as a friend, you're the best!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.220
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.930
Please eat up!

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:20.910
What about you?

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:24.070
My heart is so full
 that it's filling my stomach, too!

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.350
In that case, I'll just have some... Oh.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.910
Hey, Dark Lord! Don't
go snatching from Jahy-kun!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:35.620
Oh, it's fine. Today's party
is in honor of the Dark Lord.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:41.500
She needs to eat lots
to regain her strength...

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:48.520
It's fine. I'm fine.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:58.370
Your Lordship?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.550
Wait...

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.000
Is this for me?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.300
Look at that! The Dark Lord 
gave me this piece of octopus!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:13.740
This must mean I'm special to her!

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.450
I am so loved!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.980
Because of a tiny piece of octopus?!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.790
You mean more to me than that!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.250
I love you so much more! I love you to death!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.050
Okay, so now we have to have a serious talk.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:38.420
Let's hear what led up to you 
destroying the Dark Realm...

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:43.260
It happened on a cold winter night.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.970
I was drowning. On the verge of death.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:24.180
So I prepared myself. That's when...

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.550
<i>You are strong.</i>

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.630
<i>You managed to endure so much 
misfortune all by yourself.</i>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:43.200
<i>It wouldn't be right for 
someone like you to die here.</i>

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:45.660
<i>I shall grant you power.</i>

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.660
<i>And in return...</i>

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.130
<b>Please free people from misfortune</b>

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:52.120
Thus I gained my powers,

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:55.500
did as the voice told me, destroyed 
the mana crystal in the Dark Realm,

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.640
and collected the mana crystals on Earth.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:02.010
But now, I will spend my life 
atoning for this mistake!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.910
<i>I don't want to be stuck with 
you for the rest of my days.</i>

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.910
Just return the mana crystals and we're good.

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:09.120
<i>Actually, wait a minute...</i>

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.490
If we don't figure out 
who's behind that voice,

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:14.580
the Dark Realm won't be 
safe even if we restore it.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:18.310
Since you're our only lead, you'll be helping us!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.540
I'm going to work you hard.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.570
Please! Work me to the bone!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:25.020
Once we defeat this mastermind, 
we'll restore the Dark Realm!

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.390
But can you defeat them?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.290
With the Dark Lord by my side, it'll be a cinch!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.420
Behold how incredible she is!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:40.920
I-I mean, she just revived, so...

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.930
But she'll be back to normal soon

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.820
and leading the way for us 
with her magnificent presence.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:50.400
I'm sure she'll be praising
what I've done, too.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:52.150
Isn't that right, Your Lordship?

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.010
Did you see that?!

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:00.800
She's already pleased with me!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.410
I knew I was special to her!

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.660
The Dark Lord is an absolute 
being who needs no one.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.800
Approaching her means instant destruction,

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:13.900
yet I alone was allowed to stand next to her!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.720
And that's not all!

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.260
Only <i>I</i> was allowed to hear her words,

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:20.380
and only with <i>me</i> did she 
share her magical powers!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:23.720
After all, I was the only 
one who understood her.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.720
Even now, I totally understand what she's feeling.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.930
Hmm, hmm... I see.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:34.270
Right now, her stomach is really full
 and she can't eat any more!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.290
I don't think that's it.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:43.780
There's no way I'd misinterpret her.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.910
She's saying...

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.460
"Even if she was being used,

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.890
I'm not sure we should
expose ourselves in front

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:55.710
of the magical girl who
destroyed the Dark Realm."

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.720
"I want to formulate a restoration plan
as soon as possible,

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:01.970
but we can't do that around someone we can't trust."

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:06.680
That means she wants to move 
to my base immediately.

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:11.390
That wasn't it, huh...?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:12.920
You're leaving already?

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:16.740
But you just got here! 
You should stay longer.

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:20.250
I know! What if all three of us lived here?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:23.050
This is bigger than your
current place, Jahy-kun.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:25.320
Shut up! Nobody asked you!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.670
All three of us living
together? Are you stupid?

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:31.410
You listen here! The Dark Lord and I
have an incredible bond between us.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.790
But what about you?!

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:37.750
I'll grant you that reviving her to 
this point is an achievement of sorts,

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:42.790
but I can't believe you'd get so ahead of 
yourself as to suggest living together with her!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:47.440
I-I'd just be happy if you stayed here, so...

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.400
Your rudeness is astounding!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.610
Your Lordship, once we retrieve the crystals,

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.600
let's get out of here!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:57.400
Huh?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.200
Why?

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.160
How?

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:12.230
<i>It's the food?!</i>

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:17.430
I lost to the magical girl...

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.000
No, I lost to <i>food</i>!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.250
Damn it all!

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.840
Ah, Jahy-kun! Wait!

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.860
Damn it! Damn it!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:34.180
I'll feed you even tastier food, Your Lordship!

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.970
<i>The Great Jahy managed to make peace
with her magical girl rival.</i>

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:42.740
<i>On top of that, she was able to recover the
 mana crystals an reunite with the Dark Lord.</i>

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:47.980
<i>But it looks like winning the 
Dark Lord's heart won't be so easy.</i>

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
<b>The Boss Cannot Decide!</b>
